WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.717
Stage 1 starts by preparing:

2
00:00:01.717 --> 00:00:05.774
the group managed account's retriever
group with the test host in it,

3
00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:10.339
and the synthetic objects, an app with
two owners and a federated credential,

4
00:00:10.339 --> 00:00:13.962
and a service account whose
random password nobody records.

5
00:00:13.962 --> 00:00:16.863
The pilot's policy is created, turned off.

6
00:00:16.863 --> 00:00:20.006
The preflight records the
validation kit's baseline,

7
00:00:20.006 --> 00:00:22.863
and checks the root key is
more than ten hours old.

8
00:00:22.863 --> 00:00:26.850
Step 1.1 reads every
identity and its owners.

9
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:30.604
Step 1.2 turns the pilot
policy on for just two apps,

10
00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:33.625
and plans the tenant-wide one for review.

11
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:37.331
Step 1.3 moves the pilot
to a federated credential

12
00:00:37.331 --> 00:00:40.730
and a managed identity,
beside its old secret.
